=== Test 9: full key count but wrong CTE output column — rejected ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE lookup key references a CTE output column that is not part of the virtual primary key.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list.


=== Test 10: partial-key CTE join to non-root parent — rejected ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Partial CTE lookup key not supported.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list and the join must bind every key column.  Workaround: place the multi-key CTE on the joined root and join the smaller table to it.
